  "description": "Han Ji-wook doesn’t believe in love. He only wants a physical connection with his flings - nothing more and nothing less. And as a competent and handsome lawyer, he hasn’t had any trouble finding women who’ll listen to this simple request. However, when he meets “Areum,” a fellow lawyer on an anonymous chatting service, he finds himself falling deeper than he could have ever anticipated. He soon becomes desperate to meet and finally see the face of the woman he can’t seem to stop fantasizing about. But it looks like this lusty “lawyer” may have some secrets of her own…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
